      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Port_Hueneme%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Waterfront Promenade, also called Lighthouse Promenade, stretches along the shore and showcases the historic 1872 Wharf and Oxnard Packing House.",
